    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight Hordes of Skulls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flying skulls capable of many things.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kill all of them and wait for the next wave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761900/extras/51364a914dc7a935769e6d1a6f6a5f64.poster.avif?t=1741201989\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761900/extras/51364a914dc7a935769e6d1a6f6a5f64.webm?t=1741201989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761900/extras/51364a914dc7a935769e6d1a6f6a5f64.mp4?t=1741201989\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Use power-ups to keep going</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 different power-ups per wave, spend your coins wisely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >16 in total, hope you get the one you need.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761900/extras/6583d93f564faed8bd7a4182c6d9b0a8.poster.avif?t=1741201989\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761900/extras/6583d93f564faed8bd7a4182c6d9b0a8.webm?t=1741201989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761900/extras/6583d93f564faed8bd7a4182c6d9b0a8.mp4?t=1741201989\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good luck staying alive!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight Hordes of Skulls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flying skulls capable of many things.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kill all of them and wait for the next wave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761900/extras/51364a914dc7a935769e6d1a6f6a5f64.poster.avif?t=1741201989\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761900/extras/51364a914dc7a935769e6d1a6f6a5f64.webm?t=1741201989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761900/extras/51364a914dc7a935769e6d1a6f6a5f64.mp4?t=1741201989\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Use power-ups to keep going</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 different power-ups per wave, spend your coins wisely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >16 in total, hope you get the one you need.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761900/extras/6583d93f564faed8bd7a4182c6d9b0a8.poster.avif?t=1741201989\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761900/extras/6583d93f564faed8bd7a4182c6d9b0a8.webm?t=1741201989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761900/extras/6583d93f564faed8bd7a4182c6d9b0a8.mp4?t=1741201989\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good luck staying alive!</p>",
